5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we should start by looking at the human side. I'll examine administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to see how things actually work in the yards! I'll check the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the long-term financial trajectory. I will look into the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about things breaking and plans changing! I'll look at support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. I shall investigate the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
